on 50. Bird — scene `Bird` or CLI `-bird 1`, not together with the human.
Chicken — scene `Chicken` or `-birdKind chicken`.
Dog — scene `Dog` or CLI `-dog 1`, not together with the human.
in `World`. Tree — scene `Tree`. The human headless stand does not create
birds or trees.

